{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15104200","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1510420001:0":{"text":"크흠. 이방인이여, 너희들은 지금 보칼리스의 영주를 알현하고 있느니라.","source_cn":"咳嗯。外来者，你们正在觐见呼临城的领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB614E06384F6C3FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510420002:0":{"text":"이곳에 온 이유를 설명하라!","source_cn":"说明你们的来意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C77A9F52ADAF25F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510420003:0":{"text":"...꼬맹이?","source_cn":"……小孩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E8373446D68F4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510420004:0":{"text":"뭐, 뭐라, 누구더러 꼬맹이라는 것이냐?!","source_cn":"你、你说什么，谁是小孩？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D24650475ACADBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510420005:0":{"text":"존경하는 아반드 전하, 부디 노여움을 거두시기 바랍니다. 저희는 마법사 협회 소속으로, 최근 보칼리스에서 일어난 기근과 가뭄에 대해 연구해 왔습니다.","source_cn":"尊敬的阿邦德殿下啊，请息怒。我们是魔法师协会，一直在研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2ABC58039D2853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510420006:0":{"text":"그리고 저희에겐 이 상황을 바꿀 수 있는 방법이 있습니다. 부디 마법사 협회가 마법으로 전하와 보칼리스를 도울 수 있도록, 성 안을 자유롭게 통행하고 마법을 시전할 수 있는 권한을 허락해 주시기 바랍니다.","source_cn":"现在，我们已经想出了能改变现状的方法。希望您能赐予魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x041C0E2C3E07ED9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510420007:1":{"text":"아, 페르세우스가 얘기했어. 보칼리스는 아픈 사람이고, 너희는 보칼리스를 치료하러 온 의사라고 말이야.","source_cn":"呃，珀尔修斯说过，呼临城是生病的人，你们是来治疗的医师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5109D6AD97627480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510420008:0":{"text":"그건 일종의 비유입니다. 전하.","source_cn":"那是一种比喻，殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDC6FE63B8B7851F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510420009:1":{"text":"아, 그래? 어쨌든, 페르세우스가 너희는 좋은 사람이라고 했어.","source_cn":"呃，是吗？不管怎样，珀尔修斯说你们是好人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x571610170D6C585D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510420010:0":{"text":"페르세우스가 장담했으니, 허락하지 않을 이유가 없지!","source_cn":"他给你们担保，那我也不会不同意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFD6764036DE1F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510420011:0":{"text":"보칼리스의 영주로서, 내 너희들에게... 이것저것 권력을 주마!","source_cn":"作为呼临城领主，我给你们……各种权力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82A13FD461EAC8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510420012:1":{"text":"이렇게 하면 되지, 페르세우스?","source_cn":"这样就可以了吗，珀尔修斯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8054251BB5790C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510420013:0":{"text":"보칼리스는 전하의 지혜에 감사할 것입니다.","source_cn":"呼临城会感激殿下的英明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB512C484A72855E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510420014:0":{"text":"응, 그럼 됐어! 이제 물러가 봐.","source_cn":"嗯，那就好！可以带他们下去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB2BE8B1C329B4F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510420015:0":{"text":"네.","source_cn":"是。<key:dialog7>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x464C72B88D8828DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510420016:1":{"text":"...어, 잠깐만!","source_cn":"……诶，等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC4BAE27E0172E19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510420017:0":{"text":"저기 귀가 있는 여자아이는 누구지?","source_cn":"那个有大耳朵的女孩，你是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA184EC2AFAD7203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510420018:0":{"text":"갈라는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 하인이에요.","source_cn":"加拉是<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFAC7C773317C9940","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"갈라는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 하인이에요.","female":"갈라는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 하인이에요.","variant_male_record_index":"178763","variant_female_record_index":"178764","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510420019:0":{"text":"너... 넌 루나애니? 큰 귀에, 긴 꼬리도 있네.","source_cn":"你……你是兽人？有大耳朵，还有好长的尾巴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E65216CA594C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510420020:1":{"text":"재밌다. 나도 저런 루나애니 하인이 갖고 싶어.","source_cn":"真有趣，我也想要一个兽人仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39F669C8FC970D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510420021:0":{"text":"전하! 이건 손님을 대하는 예의가 아닙니다. 저희는 아직 마법사 협회의 도움을 받고 있지 않습니까.","source_cn":"殿下！这不是呼临城的待客之道，我们还仰仗魔法师协会的协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB900EC2BE13A84C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510420022:0":{"text":"음... 알겠어...","source_cn":"唔……好吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD0534B1849839EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1510420023:1":{"text":"비보 선생님 말씀대로네. 루나애니는 진짜 짐승 같아. 너도 날것을 먹고, 사람을 물어?","source_cn":"比博老师说得没错，兽人果然更像野兽。你是不是也咬人、吃生肉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D45C1CEF15CB510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1510420024:0":{"text":"갈라는 날것은 먹지 않아요. 하지만 사람은 물어요. 그것도 아주 아프게요.","source_cn":"加拉不吃生肉，但是加拉咬人。而且很疼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1ABB5FB9C76C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510420025:0":{"text":"싫어하는 사람은 특히 더 아프게 물죠!","source_cn":"尤其是讨厌的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3AF3E4E65D6311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1510420026:0":{"text":"...으악! 무서워라!","source_cn":"……噫！真可怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA620A99FE6DF083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1510420027:0":{"text":"페르세우스, 어, 어서 저들을 데리고 가! 루나애니 하인은 필요 없으니까!","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，快、快把他们带下去！我不要兽人仆人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C02E137A6281F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1510420028:0":{"text":"...네. 전하.","source_cn":"……是。殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA53F780018068C3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:41:1510420029:0":{"text":"페르세우스가 우리를 데리고 자리를 떴다","source_cn":"珀尔修斯带你们离开了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8DCC0D2E096FB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1510420030:0":{"text":"영주가 어린아이일 줄은 몰랐네. 그래서 보칼리스가 이 지경이 된 거구만.","source_cn":"没想到领主竟然是个小孩，怪不得呼临城会变成这幅惨象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A07F9C26DBD5D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1510420031:0":{"text":"영주님께서는 아직 어리신 탓에 주변 사람의 도움이 필요하긴 하지만, 외부인이 참견할 일은 아닙니다.","source_cn":"领主年幼，需要旁人辅佐，轮不到外人置喙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925316DC55F898A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1510420032:1":{"text":"입을 다물어야 할 땐, 다물고 있도록 하세요.","source_cn":"该闭嘴的时候，把嘴闭上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B012FA6055F510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:47:1510420032":{"text":"입을 다물어야 할 땐, 다물고 있도록 하세요.","source_cn":"该闭嘴的时候，把嘴闭上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B012FA6055F510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1510420034:0":{"text":"먼저 신중하게 의논한 뒤에 행동하는 게 좋을 것 같습니다. 절 따라오시지요.","source_cn":"先找个地方从长商议之后的行动。跟我来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37055CF25BA65867","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:47:0:1":{"text":"이제 어떡하지?","source_cn":"接下来怎么办？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD80E3ADD02639831","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이제 어떡하지?","female":"이제 어떡하지?","variant_male_record_index":"76276","variant_female_record_index":"76277","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:47:1:2":{"text":"지금 바로 성 안에서 마법을 시전할까?","source_cn":"我们立刻开始在城内设阵施法？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x526073A57B3B305E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"지금 바로 성 안에서 마법을 시전할까?","female":"지금 바로 성 안에서 마법을 시전할까?","variant_male_record_index":"76278","variant_female_record_index":"76279","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1510420033:0":{"text":"역시, 유머 감각이 제법인 신입이네.","source_cn":"看，这新人至少还有点幽默感。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x987E5F3700AFE579","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역시, 유머 감각이 제법인 신입이네.","female":"역시, 유머 감각이 제법인 신입이네.","variant_male_record_index":"178779","variant_female_record_index":"178780","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:47:2:3":{"text":"모르간은 재미있으니까 그냥 내버려 둬","source_cn":"摩根说话好听又有趣，别阻止他","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35D30A3B71CDAE70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"모르간은 재미있으니까 그냥 내버려 둬","female":"모르간은 재미있으니까 그냥 내버려 둬","variant_male_record_index":"76280","variant_female_record_index":"76281","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:51:15010432:0":{"text":"페르세우스를 따라, 보칼리스의 영주 아반드에게 예를 갖췄다.","source_cn":"在珀尔修斯的带领下，你们向呼临城领主阿邦德敬礼。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2888D42E07C6EC0F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"페르세우스를 따라, 보칼리스의 영주 아반드에게 예를 갖췄다.","female":"페르세우스를 따라, 보칼리스의 영주 아반드에게 예를 갖췄다.","variant_male_record_index":"192114","variant_female_record_index":"192115","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:领主阿邦德":{"text":"영주 아반드","source":"领主阿邦德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"페르세우스","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogu